<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech NPF 13-wk bills gross yield 18.66 percent.</title>
<headline>Czech NPF 13-wk bills gross yield 18.66 percent.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gross yield in a Dutch-style auction offering two billion crowns in 13-week Czech National Property Fund bills was 18.66 percent, the Czech National Bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It said 30.57 percent of bids at that level were accepted. Exact volumes of bids and accepted transactions were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
